### unativeint

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"type unativeint_switch =\n    {\n        Gleam : $'unativeint'\n        Lua : $'unativeint'\n        Fsharp : $'unativeint'\n        Python : $'unativeint'\n        TypeScript : $'unativeint'\n        Cpp : $'unativeint'\n        CppHost : $'unativeint'\n        Delphi : $'unativeint'\n        Cuda : $'unativeint'\n        Rust : $'usize'\n    }\nnominal unativeint = $'backend_switch `(unativeint_switch)'","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  type unativeint_switch =
      {
          Gleam : $'unativeint'
          Lua : $'unativeint'
          Fsharp : $'unativeint'
          Python : $'unativeint'
          TypeScript : $'unativeint'
          Cpp : $'unativeint'
          CppHost : $'unativeint'
          Delphi : $'unativeint'
          Cuda : $'unativeint'
